  "Cosmic Yui can summon 4 types of Veggie Knights during battle, and can stack Veggie Energy. When Veggie Energy is stacked, Cosmic Yui can activate Veg-Out Attack. This skill's damage is counted as All-Out Attack damage.\\nAt the start of the turn, gain abilities based on Veggie Knights gained, and change the color of Cosmic Yui's Phantom Thief Attire.\\nEggplant Purple: When using a skill, gain 1 more stack of Veggie Energy.\\nPotato Yellow: Increase Cosmic Yui's All-Out Attack damage by 15%.\\nMushroom Red: When dealing damage with a skill or All-Out Attack, 4.5% chance to inflict Brainwash on the target for 1 turn.\\nAsparagus Green: When dealing damage with a skill or All-Out Attack, restore Cosmic Yui's HP by 1% of the damage dealt (up to a maximum of 1000 at once).": "",
  "At the start of battle, Cosmic Yui immediately summons all 4 types of <link\\=\"s|263\"><u>Veggie Knights</u></link> and gains the maximum number of <link\\=\"s|252\"><u>Veggie Energy</u></link> stacks.\\nFor each Veggie Knight gained, increase Cosmic Yui's critical damage by 8% (up to 5 Veggie Knights).\\nAt the start of battle, Cosmic Yui changes to <link\\=\"s|254\"><u>Potato Yellow</u></link> state, and at the start of her first turn, automatically change to <link\\=\"s|253\"><u>Eggplant Purple</u></link>.": "",
  "Gain 1 more Potato Knight that will not be spent.\\nWhen activating the Resonance <link\\=\"s|262\"><u>Harvest Havoc</u></link>, increase <link\\=\"s|260\"><u>Potato Poder</u></link> effects by 10% more.\\nAt the start of battle, gain Potato Poder for 2 turns.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Veggie Knights, Go! and Veg-Out Attack by 3.": "",
  "Highlight Enhanced: Increase Cosmic Yui's Attack by 35% for 4 turns.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Harvest Fest and Thief Tactics by 3.": "",
  "Unlock the Prismatic state. Change Cosmic Yui's Phantom Thief Attire to Prismatic Color, and simultaneously gain abilities from <link\\=\"s|253\"><u>Eggplant Purple</u></link>, <link\\=\"s|254\"><u>Potato Yellow</u></link>, <link\\=\"s|255\"><u>Mushroom Red</u></link>, and <link\\=\"s|256\"><u>Asparagus Green</u></link>.\\nAt the start of battle, permanently enter <link\\=\"s|261\"><u>Huge Harvest</u></link> state, and change the following effects.\\nWhen an ally ends their action, activate the Resonance <link\\=\"s|262\"><u>Harvest Havoc</u></link>.\\nWhen using Veggie Knights, Go!, summon 1 more Potato Knight.": "",
  "r:\"^Nuke dmg to 1 foe \\(([\\d\\.]+)% Atk, gain (\\d+) Veggie Energy, and enter Huge Harvest state \\(until end of her next turn\\)\\.\\nIf Potato Knight is present when this skill is used, automatically change to Potato Yellow at end of turn\\.\\nHuge Harvest: At end of Cosmic Yui's action, activate Resonance Harvest Havoc, dealing Nuke dmg to 1 random foe \\(([\\d\\.]+)% of Atk\\)\\. Also, based on current state, activate following effects\\.\\nEggplant Purple: Gain (\\d+) Veggie Energy\\.\\nPotato Yellow: Gain Potato {{A}}, and increase All-Out Attack dmg ([\\d\\.]+)% \\((\\d+) turns\\)\\.\\nMushroom Red: Inflict Shroom Spores on target, and increase dmg taken ([\\d\\.]+)% \\((\\d+) turns\\)\\.\\nAsparagus Green: Restore (\\d+) HP to ally with lowest remaining HP\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Increase Cosmic Yui's Atk ([\\d\\.]+)%, crit rate ([\\d\\.]+)% \\((\\d+) turns\\), and summon (\\d+) Veggie Knight in specific order\\.\\nAfter using this skill, other skills can be used on same turn \\(this skill is not treated as a normal skill\\)\\.\\nPassive: At start of Cosmic Yui's action, automatically summon (\\d+) Veggie Knight in specific order\\. Max (\\d+) Eggplant Knight, Mushroom Knight, or Asparagus Knight can be summoned each\\. Max (\\d+) Potato Knights can be summoned\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Deal Nuclear damage to 1 foe equal to ([\\d\\.]+)% of Attack, and for each Veggie Knight present, deal (\\d+) more hit of Nuclear damage equal to ([\\d\\.]+)% of Attack\\. Also, if (\\d+) or more Potato Knights are present, spend all but (\\d+) Potato Knight, and for each Potato Knight spent, deal (\\d+) more hit of Nuclear damage equal to ([\\d\\.]+)% of Attack\\. This skill's damage is counted as an All-Out Attack\\.\\nWhen this skill is selected and used, gain (\\d+) Veggie Energy stacks\\.\\nIf Eggplant Knight is present after activating this skill, automatically change to Eggplant Purple state at the end of the turn\\.\\nPassive: At (\\d+) Veggie Energy stacks, able to spend all Veggie Energy stacks to activate damage effect of Veg-Out Attack\\. Damage is distributed equally among all foes\\. This is not treated as normal skill damage\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Nuke dmg to 1 foe \\(([\\d\\.]+)% Atk\\)\\. Also, according to specific rules, activate Harvest Havoc on target\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Increase Veg-Out Attack crit dmg by ([\\d\\.]+)%\\.$\"": "",
  "Change to Eggplant Purple, and gain more Veggie Energy.": "",
  "r:\"^At (\\d+) stacks, can activate Veg-Out Attack\\. This dmg is distributed equally among all foes\\.$\"": "",
